invalid type: string "CNC Machine Troubleshooting\n\nPurpose:\nProvide general troubleshooting guidance for CNC machine\nabnormalities.\n\nApplicable Machines:\nM101, M201, M301, M401 and equivalent CNC machines.\n\nCommon symptoms:\n● Overheating\n\n● Unexpected shutdown\n\n● Abnormal vibration\n\n● Unusual noise\n\n● Reduced production output\n\n● Repeated alarms\n\nInitial checks:\n